= RDF test data: N-Quads (.nq)

N-Quads serialization samples. All files are collected from W3C test suites:
the fromRdf-NNNN-in.nq files come from the JSON-LD "fromRdf" (RDF -> JSON-LD)
test suite, and the w3c-*.nq files come from the W3C RDF 1.1 N-Quads test suite.

ddot.it/this ..kind.. collected
ddot.it/this ..format.. format:n-quads
ddot.it/this ..content.. N-Quads test inputs from the W3C RDF 1.1 / JSON-LD test suites
ddot.it/this ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/rdf-tests/
ddot.it/this ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License

# JSON-LD fromRdf test inputs (RDF -> JSON-LD conversion). 23 files, fromRdf-0001-in.nq .. fromRdf-0023-in.nq.
fromRdf-*-in.nq ..kind.. collected
fromRdf-*-in.nq ..format.. format:n-quads
fromRdf-*-in.nq ..content.. N-Quads input documents for the JSON-LD fromRdf (RDF-to-JSON-LD) conversion test suite
fromRdf-*-in.nq ..tests.. plain/typed/language-tagged literals, rdf:type, blank nodes, lists, named graphs, datatype edge cases
fromRdf-*-in.nq ..source url.. https://w3c.github.io/json-ld-api/tests/
fromRdf-*-in.nq ..license.. W3C Software and Document License / W3C Test Suite License

# W3C N-Quads syntax/value tests
w3c-langtagged_string.nq ..content.. a single language-tagged string literal ("chat"@en)
w3c-langtagged_string.nq ..tests.. language tags in N-Quads
w3c-literal.nq ..content.. a simple/plain string literal quad
w3c-literal.nq ..tests.. plain literal serialization
w3c-nq-syntax-bnode-01.nq ..content.. a quad whose graph label is a blank node
w3c-nq-syntax-bnode-01.nq ..tests.. blank node as graph name
w3c-nq-syntax-bnode-06.nq ..content.. N-Quads syntax test exercising blank nodes
w3c-nq-syntax-bnode-06.nq ..tests.. blank node handling across positions
w3c-nq-syntax-uri-01.nq ..content.. N-Quads syntax test with IRI graph label
w3c-nq-syntax-uri-01.nq ..tests.. IRI as graph name
